<article class="legal-page page-section"><span class="eyebrow">HOW THE PREVIEW WORKS</span><h1>Explore freely. Book thoughtfully.</h1><p>WanderLust is a development demo for browsing places, testing hosting flows, and making simulated reservations.</p><h2>Demo reservations</h2><p>A confirmation in this app does not reserve a room with a real property. No payment is collected. Displayed prices, capacities, and the 18% demonstration tax are illustrative and do not represent a current commercial offer.</p><h2>Real property information</h2><p>The catalog links to official property pages. We do not claim a partnership with, ownership of, or verification by the listed operators. Check the official website for actual photographs, rates, availability, policies, and booking.</p><h2>Your contributions</h2><p>Only upload images you have permission to use. Keep listing details and reviews accurate and respectful. You may manage your own listings and reviews after logging in.</p><h2>Cancellation and archived listings</h2><p>A guest or host can cancel a demo reservation before its check-in day. Cancellation releases the app's demonstration inventory. Archiving a listing removes it from public discovery while preserving reservation history. No charge or refund is involved.</p><a href="/listings" class="button button-outline">Explore the catalog</a></article>
